WEBVTT

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.830
When the darkness was born,
the world was split into two orders.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.970
There were those who were
drawn to the light

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.330
and those who desired the dark.

00:01:58.466 --> 00:02:02.596
It did not take long for
these two powerful entities

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:05.273
to confront each other and clash.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:12.030
Twenty-five years later, a war
between Light and Shadow began.

00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:19.696
I... I...

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.670
What will you do if
you possess power?

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:25.200
I want to protect everyone!

00:02:35.466 --> 00:02:38.696
That is the power we have sought...

00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:44.573
Blue Dragon!

00:02:44.766 --> 00:02:49.766
THE BLUE POWER

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.430
What happened?

00:03:04.366 --> 00:03:05.626
You...

00:03:11.466 --> 00:03:13.396
A new Shadow!

00:03:13.633 --> 00:03:18.333
Don't get excited!
Our target is that kid!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.770
Capture him!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.030
Right!

00:03:27.366 --> 00:03:30.196
Stay put, kid!

00:03:33.266 --> 00:03:34.496
Not enough!

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:40.270
This won't satisfy me!

00:03:51.133 --> 00:03:53.673
N-No way...

00:03:56.633 --> 00:03:57.803
Power...

00:03:58.966 --> 00:04:03.766
Give me more power!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.930
It seems he has awakened.

00:04:08.233 --> 00:04:10.033
Awakened! Awakened!

00:04:21.466 --> 00:04:23.766
He destroyed the fleet in one sweep.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.370
A-A beast!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.830
R-Run!

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.430
What's going on?!

00:04:44.766 --> 00:04:47.796
Someone! Someone, stop him!

00:04:49.733 --> 00:04:51.033
He's going wild.

00:04:52.733 --> 00:04:53.833
If this continues,

00:04:53.866 --> 00:04:56.066
that boy will be swallowed up
by his Shadow.

00:04:57.533 --> 00:05:00.103
Jiro, I authorize you to
release your power.

00:05:01.433 --> 00:05:02.633
Stop him.

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:05.166
Right!

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.170
What's this?

00:05:19.633 --> 00:05:23.533
You let me out after all this time
to go right into a fight?

00:05:23.966 --> 00:05:26.726
Never mind the talk.
We need to stop him!

00:05:27.433 --> 00:05:28.673
Him?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.000
Oh, you mean that dragon?

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:36.926
What's with him? He looks crazy.

00:05:37.433 --> 00:05:39.603
As you can see,
he's gone wild.

00:05:40.466 --> 00:05:42.796
We need to stop him,
without destroying him.

00:05:44.433 --> 00:05:47.603
Stop the out of control dragon
without destroying him?

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.630
You make it sound so easy.

00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:53.203
Any complaints?

00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:58.566
Well, I've gotta file a complaint at least.

00:05:59.133 --> 00:06:03.133
You're gonna make me
do it anyway, right?

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.170
Let's go!

00:06:14.366 --> 00:06:16.466
Wanna see who's stronger?

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.370
Don't think you can win!

00:06:24.533 --> 00:06:25.203
What?!

00:06:30.066 --> 00:06:33.466
Stop him, someone!

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:42.533
Get serious!
Don't let that jerk beat you!

00:06:43.266 --> 00:06:45.126
What are you saying?!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.000
It's your job to sustain the power!

00:06:49.233 --> 00:06:53.173
Before you complain,
get your act together!

00:06:58.533 --> 00:07:01.403
All right!

00:07:03.166 --> 00:07:05.026
That's good!

00:07:09.566 --> 00:07:11.166
Oww!

00:07:11.966 --> 00:07:13.926
Good job, Jiro.

00:07:41.733 --> 00:07:43.133
So, you're finally awake.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.700
Shu...

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:47.933
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:07:49.866 --> 00:07:50.866
I...

00:07:55.066 --> 00:07:57.266
Oww!

00:07:59.566 --> 00:08:01.826
What's wrong with me?

00:08:03.866 --> 00:08:04.866
It's to be expected.

00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:07.303
Your Shadow went wild.

00:08:09.633 --> 00:08:10.633
Shadow?

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.530
Hey! What was that?!

00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:18.703
What happened?!

00:08:19.266 --> 00:08:20.866
I don't understand!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.600
Take it easy.

00:08:23.133 --> 00:08:24.133
Under the circumstances,

00:08:24.166 --> 00:08:26.626
I have to explain to you
from the beginning.

00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:30.703
That would help.

00:08:31.466 --> 00:08:35.826
First, are you familiar with
the Book of the Beginning?

00:08:36.666 --> 00:08:38.896
The Book of the Beginning?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.200
- Book?
- Book?

00:08:41.166 --> 00:08:45.726
I know! The oldest book in this world.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.800
Yes. A very ancient manuscript.

00:08:50.566 --> 00:08:52.426
It describes the creation of this world,

00:08:52.466 --> 00:08:54.726
and the ongoing battle
between Light and Darkness.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.830
It seems I must explain
from the very beginning.

00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:13.326
This world was created

00:09:13.366 --> 00:09:15.796
and the concepts of Light
and Darkness were born.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:24.930
Over time, these two clashed
and war began.

00:09:26.266 --> 00:09:29.196
The entire world was
caught up in this war

00:09:29.233 --> 00:09:31.303
which lasted over
a long period of time.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:36.030
It was thought the war
would continue forever...

00:09:36.066 --> 00:09:37.426
when something happened.

00:09:38.766 --> 00:09:41.526
The Seven Soldiers of Light appeared.

00:09:43.766 --> 00:09:45.766
Seven Soldiers?

00:09:46.233 --> 00:09:48.233
At this point,
you probably have it figured out.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.370
But the Seven Soldiers of Light...

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.770
They live in this area?!

00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:56.696
- Is that true?!
- Is that true?!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.870
She said it's an ancient tale!

00:10:03.266 --> 00:10:04.266
The idiot...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.170
The power possessed by
the Seven Soldiers of Light...

00:10:09.466 --> 00:10:11.296
That was the power of the Shadow.

00:10:12.333 --> 00:10:15.233
While they were called
the Soldiers of Light,

00:10:15.266 --> 00:10:17.196
they had the powers of the Darkness.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.370
The Seven Soldiers used
their powers without reserve

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.870
and put an end to the war.

00:10:25.433 --> 00:10:28.933
As a result, the powers of
the Darkness were sealed.

00:10:28.966 --> 00:10:30.426
So goes the legend.

00:10:31.533 --> 00:10:32.533
In other words,

00:10:32.566 --> 00:10:36.896
our goal is to find the descendants
of the Seven Soldiers.

00:10:37.666 --> 00:10:41.566
To counter the formidable force
known as Nene.

00:10:42.133 --> 00:10:46.433
Nene? Those soldiers
who attacked our village!

00:10:46.866 --> 00:10:49.926
Yes. They are Nene's soldiers.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:51.370
Nene?

00:10:52.533 --> 00:10:54.303
Who is Nene?

00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.396
He's the king of Grankingdom.

00:10:57.333 --> 00:10:59.933
He uses the power of
the Shadow for evil

00:10:59.966 --> 00:11:02.866
and is trying to create chaos
in this world.

00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:05.096
He's the epitome of evil.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.230
Uses the power of the Shadow for evil?

00:11:10.866 --> 00:11:15.596
Nene has found a way to create
Shadow power artificially.

00:11:16.766 --> 00:11:18.826
If left alone, terrible things will happen.

00:11:22.533 --> 00:11:25.533
I don't understand.

00:11:28.133 --> 00:11:31.103
Idiot! What have you been listening
to all this time?!

00:11:31.133 --> 00:11:34.473
You don't have to put it like that!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.330
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:11:38.266 --> 00:11:42.766
If left alone, this world will
come under Nene's rule.

00:11:46.733 --> 00:11:48.603
That's why we are on our quest

00:11:48.633 --> 00:11:50.673
to keep such a thing
from happening.

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:52.830
Let us go.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:53.670
Huh?

00:11:54.533 --> 00:11:56.033
Why do you look so puzzled?

00:11:56.633 --> 00:11:58.333
Get ready to leave immediately.

00:12:00.133 --> 00:12:02.273
What are you saying, lady?

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:05.930
You still don't understand?

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.570
You are coming with us.

00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:11.803
Huh?

00:12:21.033 --> 00:12:22.573
You still don't understand?

00:12:23.766 --> 00:12:25.996
You are coming with us.

00:12:28.033 --> 00:12:29.203
I'm opposed to that.

00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:33.466
I admit... He has the power.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.270
But look what happened!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.600
Even if we take him,
he'll only be a burden to us.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.070
And how were you
in the beginning?

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.570
It's decided.

00:12:51.166 --> 00:12:52.966
We have no time to
debate the issue.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.670
Now, get ready.

00:12:56.266 --> 00:12:56.926
Huh?!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.370
Wait!

00:12:59.733 --> 00:13:01.973
You can't decide everything
like that!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.800
Besides, just who are you?!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.430
You refused to help
the village earlier!

00:13:08.466 --> 00:13:10.796
And denied being
the Knight Master!

00:13:12.366 --> 00:13:16.196
I can't simply put my trust
in someone like that!

00:13:17.266 --> 00:13:18.326
Shu!

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.670
I'm not telling you to trust me.

00:13:21.766 --> 00:13:24.996
I'm telling you because
there's no other option.

00:13:27.133 --> 00:13:29.333
If you stay here,
they'll keep sending troops in.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:33.070
It will be troublesome if
you don't leave before that.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.030
What about the village?!

00:13:36.766 --> 00:13:37.766
Are you gonna just ignore it?!

00:13:38.433 --> 00:13:41.573
If you are gone,
there shouldn't be any more attack.

00:13:43.333 --> 00:13:49.533
As long as you stay in this village,
the enemy will keep sending troops.

00:13:51.066 --> 00:13:52.766
The power of the Shadow
is dangerous.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:55.430
Even if you're able to
release that power,

00:13:55.466 --> 00:13:57.926
it is useless unless
you can control it.

00:13:59.633 --> 00:14:03.703
Uncontrollable power is
just a detriment.

00:14:06.066 --> 00:14:09.426
Do you understand now?
That you have no choice?

00:14:11.066 --> 00:14:11.726
No...

00:14:13.533 --> 00:14:15.033
I won't have that!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:16.770
Shu!

00:14:17.033 --> 00:14:18.333
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:14:20.066 --> 00:14:22.496
Zola, you're cruel.

00:14:23.566 --> 00:14:24.666
What do you mean?

00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:30.133
You didn't have to back him
into a corner like that.

00:14:31.466 --> 00:14:32.926
You have compassion for him now?

00:14:34.433 --> 00:14:36.803
It brings back memories
and it tastes bitter.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.000
The beginning is crucial
with things like this.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:47.270
He has to be committed.
Otherwise, he's no good.

00:14:49.533 --> 00:14:53.073
That battle earlier...
You had it all planned, didn't you?

00:14:56.466 --> 00:15:01.666
Perhaps you knew from the start
that he had the power?

00:15:03.666 --> 00:15:05.626
If you want to give me credit, fine.

00:15:06.033 --> 00:15:08.803
But don't try to guess my motives.

00:15:11.233 --> 00:15:12.233
I know that.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.270
I'm just trying to make sense.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.400
Leave it at that.

00:15:18.466 --> 00:15:20.096
Our goal is one.

00:15:21.033 --> 00:15:22.203
To destroy Nene.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.630
Whatever you are thinking,
that will not change.

00:15:28.633 --> 00:15:31.733
And that's enough for me!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.500
Shu...

00:15:50.066 --> 00:15:54.766
I'm supposed to abandon my village
because that thing appeared?

00:15:58.066 --> 00:16:00.466
I don't understand anything anymore.

00:16:01.866 --> 00:16:03.266
Cheer up!

00:16:04.033 --> 00:16:07.273
You said men were
supposed to have adventures!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.270
It's too sudden! This is crazy!

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.200
I'm not ready at all!

00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:17.633
And now,
I have this weird power in me.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.770
I don't know anything!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.600
There, there.

00:16:29.866 --> 00:16:31.926
You're just scared.

00:16:32.766 --> 00:16:34.296
That's not it!

00:16:34.466 --> 00:16:35.996
What's the big idea?!

00:16:36.666 --> 00:16:38.126
It's all right, Shu.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.270
I'll never leave you alone.

00:16:46.866 --> 00:16:48.726
It's another attack!

00:16:49.233 --> 00:16:50.773
Run for it!

00:16:58.033 --> 00:16:59.703
What are those? Robots?!

00:16:59.733 --> 00:17:02.473
No way! How do they work?!

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:04.930
Damn those guys!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.900
As long as you stay
in this village,

00:17:07.933 --> 00:17:10.733
the enemy will keep
sending troops.

00:17:14.733 --> 00:17:15.733
I'll do it!

00:17:18.033 --> 00:17:20.133
I will protect this village!

00:17:21.833 --> 00:17:22.503
Shu?

00:17:31.833 --> 00:17:33.833
Come on out, you beast!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.170
Huh?

00:17:39.066 --> 00:17:40.666
What are you doing?!

00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:42.966
What's wrong?

00:17:44.366 --> 00:17:46.066
Why won't it come out?!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:48.000
I told you...

00:17:49.866 --> 00:17:52.366
You can't control the power yet.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.370
Watch carefully.

00:17:59.266 --> 00:18:02.596
This is how you go into battle
with your Shadow.

00:18:16.533 --> 00:18:17.533
Me too!

00:18:18.166 --> 00:18:19.166
That's not necessary.

00:18:20.366 --> 00:18:22.096
I will handle this alone.

00:18:24.366 --> 00:18:25.026
Understood.

00:18:25.466 --> 00:18:27.266
Here I come, small fries!

00:19:05.266 --> 00:19:06.266
Wow...

00:19:06.433 --> 00:19:07.833
That's the power of the Shadow.

00:19:35.966 --> 00:19:40.566
Merge and transformation!
A dream-come-true for all guys!

00:19:41.433 --> 00:19:43.103
I really want that!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:47.130
- So cool! I want it! I want it!
- That's the enemy, you know.

00:19:47.166 --> 00:19:49.796
- I want it!
- It's a bad robot.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.170
Not so fast.

00:19:52.966 --> 00:19:53.626
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:19:54.166 --> 00:19:58.426
What fool would just wait
until they finish merging!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:01.700
The finishing blow!

00:20:02.733 --> 00:20:04.533
Hornet Pierce!

00:20:21.166 --> 00:20:22.166
Wow...

00:20:40.366 --> 00:20:41.626
You made up your mind?

00:20:42.566 --> 00:20:43.796
I'm coming with you guys.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.600
But, let me just say this.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.200
I'm not going because you told me to.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.330
It was my decision!

00:20:54.866 --> 00:20:55.866
Fine.

00:20:57.233 --> 00:20:58.803
Wait!

00:20:58.833 --> 00:20:59.833
Kluke...

00:21:03.666 --> 00:21:04.896
I made it!

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:09.530
What's this? I told you
I didn't need a send-off.

00:21:10.066 --> 00:21:11.626
- But...
- But...

00:21:12.066 --> 00:21:13.066
Sheesh!

00:21:14.366 --> 00:21:17.266
I'm coming back!
Don't worry!

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.570
- Bro!
- Bro!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:20.600
Don't cry!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.930
How can I leave this village
in the care of crybabies?!

00:21:25.533 --> 00:21:26.203
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:32.570
Until I return, this village is
in your hands!

00:21:34.533 --> 00:21:35.973
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:21:37.966 --> 00:21:42.796
Kluke... Take care of them and Gramps.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.500
Nope!

00:21:45.833 --> 00:21:46.533
Huh?!

00:21:46.566 --> 00:21:48.226
You've got it wrong.

00:21:48.766 --> 00:21:52.096
Who said anything about a send-off?

00:21:52.466 --> 00:21:53.126
Huh?!

00:21:54.433 --> 00:21:55.933
I'm coming too!

00:21:56.266 --> 00:21:58.996
Huh? What are you saying?!

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.500
- We're not going for fun!
- I've decided!

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:08.700
And so... Please let me come along!

00:22:12.266 --> 00:22:13.396
As you please.

00:22:14.666 --> 00:22:16.266
Yes!

00:22:16.933 --> 00:22:20.333
Hey hey! What's going on?!

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:24.330
Let's go.
We have no time to waste.

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:25.500
Yes!

00:22:25.766 --> 00:22:29.696
You should think this over
very carefully.

00:22:29.766 --> 00:22:31.096
Besides...

00:22:31.133 --> 00:22:33.133
Hey, wait!

00:22:33.166 --> 00:22:36.496
- Bro! Take care!
- Bro! Take care!

00:22:36.533 --> 00:22:39.333
Hey, are you listening?!

00:22:39.533 --> 00:22:41.933
Oh breakfast!
What do you want for breakfast?!

00:22:41.966 --> 00:22:43.996
Huh? Oh well...

00:22:44.033 --> 00:22:45.373
Shut up and walk!

00:24:20.466 --> 00:24:22.366
Shu's rivalry against Jiro...

00:24:22.400 --> 00:24:25.670
However, their rivalry develops
into a strong friendship.

00:24:26.466 --> 00:24:28.296
Jiro, I can't do it anymore.

00:24:28.333 --> 00:24:31.403
Don't give up, Shu!
You sweat the tears of your heart!

00:24:31.433 --> 00:24:34.333
Let's run towards that blazing sunset!

00:24:34.366 --> 00:24:35.366
Right!

00:24:35.400 --> 00:24:36.400
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:24:36.433 --> 00:24:38.733
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Shu and Jiro"
